stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Fresh: trigger (watcher / timer / CLI / attach)
    Fresh --> InFlight: provider not current, or a revision<br/>or the tip tree is missing
    Fresh --> Read: store files current
    Read --> Gate: for each member copy<br/>R from live heads by ancestry<br/>(equal-hash TIPS converge, never vs history)<br/>L = hash(local), B = last synced
    Gate --> Detached: UNEXPECTED change (ADR 0030)<br/>local delete, store lost, store went backwards,<br/>deck gone, rebound, foreign device id,<br/>variable collision, duplicate, stale-version edit
    Gate --> Paused: expected pause<br/>unshared, version mismatch, schema guard
    Gate --> Forked: live heads don't converge
    Gate --> Compare: R subsumes every live head and B
    Compare --> InSync: L == R
    Compare --> Behind: L == B, R not equivalent to B
    Compare --> Ahead: L != B, R equivalent to B
    Compare --> HoldLocal: L != B, R not equivalent to B,<br/>this host BLOCKED or fingerprint unknown
    Compare --> Diverged: L != B, R not equivalent to B
    Diverged --> Forked: push local edit as its own revision
    Behind --> Apply: two-phase apply (ADR 0008)
    Ahead --> Push: tree, revision (parent R),<br/>head written last, then B
    Apply --> Blocked: verify failed, rolled back
    Apply --> InSync: verified, head then B := R
    Push --> InSync: head then B := new revision
    Forked --> Notify: deduplicated alert,<br/>no app files touched
    HoldLocal --> Notify: edit kept local, not pushed
    Blocked --> Notify
    Paused --> Notify
    Detached --> Notify: drops out of this setup,<br/>profile left as-is, persists
    InFlight --> [*]: retry next tick, alarm if stuck
    InSync --> [*]
    Notify --> [*]: waits for resolve / unblock / reshare / user
